Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tremble, right hand of mine...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.45,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,By the contract we made, I order you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,to shroud yourself in black flame \Nand grant my desire!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can't heat up my chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mayuri, this is no longer a microwave. \NIt's a time machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.09,0:00:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you join the lab, you'll be dealing with this all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.51,0:00:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then go buy me a new microwave, Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.06,0:00:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you photographing me is prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No photos!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.15,0:00:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, done programming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,PhoneWave, 2nd edition, Version 1.03 is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.12,0:00:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you can use the \NPhoneWave's cell phone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,to send a D-Mail to any phone you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.49,0:00:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, Daru!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.41,0:01:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's continue our experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really a time machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.33,0:01:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.59,0:01:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't you think the landlord \Nwill get mad at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.18,0:01:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Part-time warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.64,0:01:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Mr. Braun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.77,0:01:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call my dad "Mr. Braun"...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the boss? He's out on a service call.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he'll be back for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.19,0:01:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't, I wouldn't be screwing around outsi—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.03,0:01:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
