Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Juicy Chicken Number 1 would taste better...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's no Dr Pepper!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They were out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.29,0:03:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're out, keep looking until you find some!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to be a Dr Pepperian.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You want some or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.43,0:03:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.84,0:04:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of mad scientist worries about \Nnot getting enough vegetables?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin the Round Table.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot in here. Let's open a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.02,0:04:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Daru?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.94,0:04:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the Organization discovers our secret...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.61,0:04:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Delusion fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.70,0:04:19.66,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\frx10\fry2\an8\fscx167.5\fscy145\frz319.25\pos(808.5,585)}What's a Round Table?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now move Operation Urd to stage two,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and take experiments on D-Mail
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,to a more practical level.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.79,0:04:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In the summer, you gotta have barley tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Want some too, Moeka?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Practical? What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Change the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.43,0:04:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... That's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you create a time paradox...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistant, as a scientist,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.44,0:04:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't you interested in whether we can \Nalter the past using D-Mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.44,0:04:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But what will we change?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:04:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.90,0:05:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's what I want to accomplish \Nwith this operation...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Win the lottery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.54,0:05:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin... Mayushii is very sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.17,0:05:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.63,0:05:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had money, I could buy \Nnew parts for the computer,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and I could go to MayQueen all I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think we should work toward world peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.72,0:05:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Like give everyone in the world an Upa cushion...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.06,0:05:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, that's really lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.77,0:05:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an experiment to see \Nif we can change the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be the easiest way to tell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.27,0:05:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But basically, you just want money, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.69,0:05:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Celeb 17!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Cele... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Celeb 17!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.66,0:05:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear anything from a woman
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.07,0:05:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,living in a hotel on her parent's money!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are all kinds of lottery tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.63,0:05:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:05:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd Moeka go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.13,0:06:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.81,0:06:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh... I can't take my eyes \Noff you for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.02,0:06:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because you didn't respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.73,0:06:16.81,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\t(0,2080,\fs85.5)\move(475.5,603,432,607.5,0,2065)}I really want to borrow \Nthe IBN 5100. Please... \NI'll take that as a yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she supposed to be a valley girl LOL?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Christina, keep a close eye on her,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,so she doesn't wander around!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.74,0:06:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to see the lab, Moeka?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you around later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii is good at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it for Kurisu too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.63,0:06:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where should I start?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.26,0:06:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The LOTO SIX.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Every Thursday, \Nthe winning numbers are announced.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll send the numbers to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're really doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You have any other bright ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.19,0:06:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Which division numbers do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, first division prize is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,two hundred million yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.15,0:07:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Two hundred million yen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Daru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Two hundred million yen is a bit much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.28,0:07:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,First division would draw too much attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization is chasing me, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You have cold feet, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.04,0:07:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's second division?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-three million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.09,0:07:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Third?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe's a chicken, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.68,0:07:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's coming from someone\Nworried about a time paradox, Celeb 17?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is the Upa cushion!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.93,0:07:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're tired or feeling down,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.85,0:07:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you give it a hug, like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.81,0:07:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is the fridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.11,0:07:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's inside today?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.40,0:07:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining Finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your first mission as a lab mem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:07:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, your first job!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.42,0:08:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of what to write in the D-Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Something that'll make the me of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.55,0:08:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,one week ago want to buy a LOTO SIX ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.84,0:08:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven days ago
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.76,0:08:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,would be 168 hours,\Nso about 170 seconds on the timer should do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.31,0:08:17.18,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx121.25\fscy130\pos(354,769.5)\frx4\fry358\c&HE7E7E7&}Buy LOTO SIX \NYou'll win!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm... That sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.18,0:08:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.06,0:08:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, the time has come to open Steins Gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.65,0:08:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.98,0:08:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You really never tire of it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.03,0:08:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And you need to stop whining \Nabout it every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You looked like you were having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.99,0:08:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's not like I'm having fun, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, our assistant sure is a tsundere.{Katy Perry song, obv. Original: stuff about tsundere}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's a tsundere?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, Miss Makise, you've heard of tsunderes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.51,0:08:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you definitely responded like you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I haven't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm starting up the microwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.07,0:09:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you create a time paradox...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.41,0:09:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I so scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.34,0:09:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,El Psy Kongroo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.01,0:09:33.05,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2.85\frz353.869\c&H585249&\pos(847.5,348)}Sending...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.05,0:09:35.01,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.85\frz353.869\c&H585249&\pos(882,502.5)}Sent
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.99,0:09:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.91,0:10:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How long have I been standing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,About 30 seconds, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.47,0:10:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.85,0:10:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.56,0:10:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just talking about an experiment \Nto see if we could change the past with a D-Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You ran over to the PhoneWave
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and started panting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii, can you say "panting" again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.11,0:10:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:42.54,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\frz359.505\pos(468,739.5)}Buy LOTO SIX
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.33,0:10:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:43.50,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\frz359.505\pos(468,739.5)}You'll win!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, are you really all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.04,0:10:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The LOTO SIX!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.17,0:10:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Celeb Sev,  did I win third prize?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.80,0:10:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me Celeb Sev....
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.93,0:10:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.34,0:10:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? You...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.72,0:11:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The experiment?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We did an experiment to see if we could \Nchange the past with the D-Mail...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just talking about what we could
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.77,0:11:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,do for the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.36,0:11:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii wants something \Nthat'll bring about world peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.28,0:11:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Like giving everyone in the world an Upa cushion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You really don't remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Luka!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.29,0:11:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Luka?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.09,0:11:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.89,0:11:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,02, 12, 18...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.85,0:11:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.02,0:11:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lukako! Where did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.94,0:11:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... You gave me the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.90,0:11:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.98,0:11:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me to buy it since it might win.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.69,0:11:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-When?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.40,0:11:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,One week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.95,0:12:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Okarin's a psychic!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Luka, did you win?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.25,0:12:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... I got one of the numbers wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So close!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, did you use the PhoneWave to...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.35,0:12:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's no Dr Pepper!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.77,0:12:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't have any.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do about it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.94,0:12:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt that I sent the D-Mail,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.45,0:12:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's no record of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,515)}The past has been changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.50,0:12:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't remember the experiment,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,even though we all talked about it, \Nand we all observed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.34,0:12:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Only I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Only I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This feeling! It's just like back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.56,0:13:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.27,0:13:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like you've been brainwashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.67,0:13:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Brainwashed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But was I the one brainwashed... or were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.94,0:13:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.48,0:13:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not brainwashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:13:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Chip?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's "brainwashed"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.24,0:14:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Hououin Kyouma, will tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.12,0:14:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Nae's scared of Okabe Rintaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.50,0:14:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Electricity?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.88,0:14:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean when there are all those sparks?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it before, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There should've been one 10 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.60,0:14:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't notice that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.81,0:14:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you, Nae?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.89,0:14:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.15,0:14:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.82,0:14:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a pervert-gentleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.23,0:14:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you that you can hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.32,0:14:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know it was this bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.78,0:14:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear about the time machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.62,0:14:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Nice job, I guess!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.91,0:14:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me warn you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I know... I won't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.92,0:14:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you worried about something \Nrelated to the time machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.29,0:15:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why not ask John Titor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.47,0:15:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,\NJohn Titor mentioned this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go to the past and change it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,this alters something called \Nthe divergence number,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.98,0:15:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and the worldline moves to another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.35,0:15:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,When there's a worldline shift, \Npeople's memories are altered,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.32,0:15:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and memories of the new world are created.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.70,0:15:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The D-Mail moved the worldline
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.03,0:15:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,from a world where Lukako \Ndidn't buy the LOTO SIX ticket
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,to one where he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.04,0:15:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The worldline changed, and so did the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,In this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.67,0:15:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't send the D-Mail\Nwith the winning LOTO SIX number
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.46,0:15:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,into the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.34,0:15:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that the other lab mems \Ndon't remember the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So why am I the only one who remembers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.77,0:16:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nae, whatever he asks, \Ndon't tell him I was slacking off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.45,0:16:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you give me a ride on your bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.53,0:16:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe Rintaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.83,0:16:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on your side, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.09,0:16:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.42,0:16:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.26,0:16:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you doing with my daughter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.55,0:16:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait! I wasn't doing anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.05,0:16:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A guy like you wouldn't be able to control his desires if left alone with my adorable daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you always think about me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And we weren't alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzuha was just here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.48,0:16:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Is that true, Nae?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised, so I can't say she was slacking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.61,0:16:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.70,0:16:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Part-timer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.16,0:16:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock on wood!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You were slacking off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.66,0:16:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Argh, you left the 42-inch on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.67,0:17:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.43,0:17:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain why later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We're stopping the experiment for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.97,0:17:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1020)}Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.15,0:17:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So, little miss assistant there, you're not going home?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just thinking about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.53,0:17:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be all alone if you went back to the hotel,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,so you want me to spend time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, little Celeb Sev?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.50,0:17:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me Celeb Sev!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta send this text message.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.84,0:17:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to stay here, be quiet, The Zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the name that bugs me the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're like a girl, \Nwaiting for a message from her crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.11,0:18:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You really want attention that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.29,0:18:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was that message for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.91,0:18:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,John Titor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.59,0:18:30.09,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\frz0.305\fscx122.5\fscy120\pos(1068,327)}Lukako
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.59,0:18:30.09,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\frz0.305\fscx117.5\fscy117.5\pos(1066.5,469.5)}The Lottery
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.59,0:18:30.09,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx147.5\fscy137.5\frz359.901\pos(315,694.5)\c&HEAEAEA&}I'm really sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.93,0:18:37.14,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs97.5\be8\fr-24\c&H9D9D9D&\fax-.2\move(1159.5,555,1315.5,379.5)}I Had Fun
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.93,0:18:37.14,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs82.5\be8\move(768,688.5,922.5,510)\fax-0.2\c&H838383&\frz359.8\fr-24}Next time, tell me about \Nthe time machine. \NIt's a promise. \NA promise, right? \NBye! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.65,0:18:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.02,0:18:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, I realized I made a huge mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.57,0:18:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A mistake? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.49,0:18:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually... Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.49,0:19:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I left my wallet at the lab!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.49,0:19:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.99,0:19:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So now I can't get into MayQueen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, would you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru's with you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.22,0:19:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to lend him money, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Okarin, do you feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.60,0:19:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, you can hug Mayushii's Upa, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.89,0:19:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you'll feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.31,0:19:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.36,0:19:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hanging up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.24,0:19:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, you're smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.75,0:19:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I read your message.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as you deduced,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.97,0:19:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the past was changed, and the worldline has undoubtedly moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The one thing I don't understand
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.97,0:20:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,is why you retain your memories \Nfrom before the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.31,0:20:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.31,0:20:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.65,0:20:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Something similar happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.23,0:20:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.65,0:20:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The concept of changing the past
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.61,0:20:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,via email was never considered,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,even in the year 2036.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.33,0:20:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You changed the past and moved worldlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's never been confirmed if
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone alive can maintain their memories
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,over a worldline jump and observe the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.34,0:20:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma, you may have that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.93,0:20:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be able to lead the world
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.65,0:20:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,beyond Divergence 1%...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.73,0:20:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What lies beyond Divergence 1%?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.49,0:21:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.29,0:21:08.37,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2.25\frz356.676\fscx67.5\fscy80\c&H111614&\pos(916.5,514.5)}Sending...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.37,0:21:09.50,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fscx75\fscy85\c&H1F2624&\frz356.676\pos(898.5,366)}Sent
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.55,0:21:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What lies beyond it is true freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.35,0:21:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't cross that barrier,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.31,0:21:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the future will become a dystopia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.44,0:21:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My goal is to change the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And you may be the one who has that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.82,0:21:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? Change the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.41,0:21:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.13,0:22:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.55,0:22:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.01,0:22:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,...you to be the messiah.
